    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473090/extras/6ec25e22f43fba4e9b27adaac66e5cc3.avif?t=1705276890\" /></span><br><br>It is an action game where you embark on an adventure with the protagonist in a decaying planet. The world is inhabited by two factions, the Wardens and the Human Survivors. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473090/extras/03f880aeb70bc7ad4dc655e8b11725e4.avif?t=1705276890\" /></span><br>The main character must find all six pieces to repair the spaceship in order to continue the journey. Obtaining the six pieces requires navigating through challenging stories and making difficult decisions involving the people on this planet. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473090/extras/9887bfd4b1f0b9d7edd5d7de9b76c029.avif?t=1705276890\" /></span><br>Additionally, there are risky and dangerous combat encounters that must be overcome.",
